---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import "../styles/global.css";

---

<Layout>
 
<main>
       <header class="header">
        <div class="w-full max-w-screen-xl flex justify-between items-center gap-6 text-white bg-sky-950 p-4 rounded-b-lg">
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-110"> 
            <input type="text" class="w-35 bg-white text-black rounded-3xl" placeholder="Buscar" id="Buscar" />
            <div class="w-20 bg-white text-black flex justify-center hover:bg-cyan-400 rounded-3xl transform transition-transform duration-5 hover:scale-105  object-cover"> 
                <a href="/">Inicio</a>
            </div>
            <div id="theme-switcher" class="z-50 ml-25">
                <button id="theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle dark-mode">
                    <svg id="moon-icon" class="theme-icon hover:bg-cyan-400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"></path>
                    </svg>

                    <svg id="sun-icon" class="theme-icon hover:bg-orange-400 hidden" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle>
                        <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
                        <line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                        <line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"></line>
                        <line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"></line>
                        <line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line>
                        <line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"></line>
                        <line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"></line>
                        <line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"></line>
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

<nav class="mt-20 left-0 w-full flex justify-center py-6 z-50 "> 
  <div class="mx-full flex justify-around items-center w-full max-w-145 bg-sky-950 text-white p-4 gap-4 rounded-2xl">
    <a href="/" class="text-center hover:text-gray-400 font-semibold">Inicio</a>
    <a href="/Nosotros" class="text-center hover:text-gray-400 font-semibold">Nosotros</a>
    <a href="/Blog" class="text-center hover:text-gray-400 font-semibold">Blogs</a>
    <a href="/Academia" class="text-center hover:text-gray-400 font-semibold">Academia</a>
    
    <li class="relative submenu group cursor-pointer py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors duration-300 list-none hover:text-gray-400">
      <a href="http://localhost:4321/Servicios">Servicio</a><a class="text-cyan-400 ml-1">⮟</a>
      
      <ul class="absolute top-9 mt-2 w-48 bg-gray-700 text-white p-2 rounded-b-lg shadow-lg subitems hidden group-hover:block z-10">
        <li><a href="http://localhost:4321/Abogado" class="block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-cyan-700 rounded">Abogados</a></li>
        <li><a href="http://localhost:4321/Detective" class="block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-cyan-700 rounded">Detectives</a></li>
        <li><a href="http://localhost:4321/Poligrafista" class="block px-4 py-2 hover:bg-cyan-700 rounded">Poligrafistas</a></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </div>
</nav>
<div class=" flex flex-col items-center animate-fadeSlideUp reveal-item mt-6">
  <img src="./Imagenes/19.webp" alt="Imagen publica acerca de a funcion de abogados Penalistas">
  <h1 class="text-black w-250 text-3xl font-special text-start mt-4">Bienvenido. a nuestra área de psicofisiología Forense
    donde te ofrecemos nuestros servicios de poligrafia especializada, contamos con herramientas confiables y precisas
    para la deteccio de engaños y obtención de información veraz. Nuestro equipo de expertos en comunicación no 
    verbal estan capacitados en tecnicas mas azanzadas en poligrafia y utilizan equipos de ultima generación para brindar
    resultados confiables en cada prueba. 
  </h1>
</div>
<div class="acordeon-content hidden overflow-hidden transition-max-height duration-700 ease-in-out mt-4">
        <div class="p-4 border border-t-0 border-gray-300 bg-white">
            <p class="mb-4">Puedes dar clic en cada imagen para conocer más sobre esa capacitación:</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
                <div class="border rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
                    <img src="/Imagenes/16.webp" alt="Diplomado en Derecho Penal General" class="w-full h-auto object-cover">
                    <p class="p-2 text-sm text-center">DIPLOMADO EN DERECHO PENAL GENERAL</p>
                </div>
                <div class="border rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
                    <img src="/ruta/a/diplomado-procesal-penal.jpg" alt="Diplomado en Derecho Procesal Penal" class="w-full h-auto object-cover">
                    <p class="p-2 text-sm text-center">DIPLOMADO EN PROCESAL PENAL</p>
                </div>
                </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="acordeon-item font-special mt-4">
    <button class="acordeon-header flex justify-between items-center w-full p-4 bg-sky-900 text-white font-bold rounded-lg focus:outline-none">
        <span>CLIC AQUÍ - OFERTA EDUCATIVA EN INVESTIGACIÓN CRIMINAL</span>
        <span class="acordeon-icon transform transition-transform duration-300">▼</span>
    </button>

    <div class="acordeon-content hidden overflow-hidden transition-max-height duration-700 ease-in-out ">
        <div class="p-4 border border-t-0 border-gray-300 bg-white ">
            <p>Contenido de la oferta en Investigación Criminal...</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                <div class="border rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md">
                    <img src="/ruta/a/vigilancia-y-seguimiento.jpg" alt="Vigilancia y Seguimiento" class="w-full h-auto object-cover">
                    <p class="p-2 text-sm text-center">VIGILANCIA Y SEGUIMIENTO</p>
                </div>
                </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="acordeon-item mt-4 font-special">
    <button class="acordeon-header flex justify-between items-center w-full p-4 bg-sky-900 text-white font-bold rounded-lg focus:outline-none">
        <span>CLIC AQUÍ - LIBROS Y MANUALES</span>
        <span class="acordeon-icon transform transition-transform duration-300">▼</span>
    </button>
    <div class="acordeon-content hidden overflow-hidden transition-max-height duration-700 ease-in-out">
        <div class="p-4 border border-t-0 border-gray-300 bg-white">
            <p>Aquí se mostrarán los libros y manuales disponibles...</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 text-center mt-5 reveal-item animate-fadeSlideUp">
    <div class="mb-5">
        <h1 class="text-black font-bold text-2xl">SERVICIOS EN PRUEBAS DE POLIGRAFO</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start">
        
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <img src="./Imagenes/20.webp" class="reveral-item scala cursor-pointer">
            <h2 class="font-bold mt-2">Pruebas de Preempleo</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <img src="./Imagenes/21.webp" class="reveral-item scala cursor-pointer">
            <h2 class="font-bold mt-2">Pruebas de Rutina</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <img src="./Imagenes/22.webp" class="reveral-item scala cursor-pointer">
            <h2 class="font-bold mt-2">Pruebas de Específicas</h2>
            <h3>Conoce mas</h3>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

        </div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-screen-md mx-auto flex justify-center items-center gap-6 text-white p-4 rounded-b-lg rounded-lg shadow-xl border-gray-300 mt-8">
    <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-black">Formulario de Contacto</h2>
        <form class="space-y-4">
            <div>
                <label class="block text-gray-700">Nombre de tu Empresa</label>
                <input type="text" class="w-full border-2 p-[7px] drop-shadow-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-black" />
            </div>
            <div>
                <label class="block text-gray-700">Teléfono</label>
                <input type="tel" class="w-full border-2 p-[7px] drop-shadow-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-black" />
            </div>
            <div>
                <label class="block text-gray-700">Email</label>
                <input type="email" class="w-full border-2 p-[7px] drop-shadow-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-black" />
            </div>
            <div>
                <label class="block text-gray-700">Dirección</label>
                <input type="text" class="w-full border-2 p-[7px] drop-shadow-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-black" />
            </div>
            <div>
                <label class="block text-gray-700">Mensaje</label>
                <input type="text" class="w-full border-2 p-[7px] drop-shadow-sm px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-black h-20" />
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
  <main>
    <div class="w-full mx-auto bg-gray-50 rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden h-[500px] mt-8">
      <Fragment set:html={`<iframe
        class="w-full h-115"
        src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3986.1972979500597!2d-76.60902782400156!3d2.441234657094157!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x8e30030554ee777d%3A0xd3194ddf180ab808!2sCentro%2C%20Popay%C3%A1n%2C%20Cauca!5e0!3m2!1ses-419!2sco!4v1754101169253!5m2!1ses-419!2sco"
        title="Mapa de Popayán"
        style="border:0;"
        allowfullscreen
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>`} />
    </div>

    </div>
</div>

</div>
        <div class="pt-5"> <div class="grid grid-cols-4 grid-rows-1 gap-20 w-full h-auto mb-4">
                <div class="col-start-2 col-span-3 text-black text-right pr-4">
                    Cree siempre en la verdad
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex justify-end items-center gap-6 bg-sky-950 p-6 w-full mt-8 ">
              
            <a href="https://github.com/Revan007pro" target="_blank">
  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white hover:text-gray-300">
    <use href="/sprites.svg#github" />
  </svg>
</a>
<a href="https://youtube.com" target="_blank">
  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-red-600 hover:text-red-700"> 
    <use href="/sprites.svg#youtube" /> 
  </svg>
</a>


<a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank">
  <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-700">
    <use href="/sprites.svg#instagram" />
  </svg>
</a>
</a>
        </div>

        <footer class="w-full text-center py-4 mt-4 text-gray-600">
            <p>Este es el pie de página.</p>
            <p>© 2025 Mi Proyecto. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
            <a href="#">Ver Terminos y condiciones</a>
        </footer>

    </div>



</main>
</Layout>